c","poster","/GameMap/assets/media/demos/recording-marble-blue-diner.webp","aspectRatio",1.7777777777777777,"mobile","previewSrc","预览说明","World Labs Marble 官方镜头游览蓝色灯光餐厅，画面中有卡座、吧台、顶灯和棋盘格地面。","alt","记录类型","原始项目记录","role","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","相关项目",[98],"resourceId",{"_54":99,"_26":100},"World Labs Marble","/zh/resources/marble/","演示内容与范围","这是官方场景漫游录片，并非完整游戏，也不能据此认定有已编写的玩法系统。产品生成与导出有账户和套餐要求；碰撞网格与高质量带纹理 GLB 属于不同导出功能。","limitations","演示类别","场景生成","demoType","lead","3d","scenes","source-recording","recordingId","marble","resource:marble","resource","生成可持续导航的 3D 场景，支持 splat 与网格导出。","/zh/resources/",{"_20":112,"_187":99,"_185":188,"_52":189,"_186":115,"_181":180,"_26":70,"_64":190,"_162":191,"_157":192,"_153":193,"_147":194,"_144":143},[120,121,122,123,124,125,126,127,128,129,130,131,132,133],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_52":22,"_56":99,"_58":187,"_60":-7,"_62":63},{"_52":107,"_56":115,"_58":186,"_60":-7,"_62":36},{"_52":53,"_54":184,"_56":154,"_58":185,"_60":94,"_62":36},{"_52":53,"_54":182,"_56":183,"_58":52,"_60":94,"_62":36},{"_52":53,"_54":179,"_56":180,"_58":181,"_60":61,"_62":36},{"_52":64,"_54":176,"_66":177,"_58":26,"_60":-7},{"_52":64,"_54":168,"_66":169,"_58":64,"_60":-7},{"_52":148,"_54":160,"_150":151,"_66":161,"_58":162,"_60":-7,"_62":63},{"_52":148,"_54":155,"_150":151,"_66":156,"_58":157,"_60":-7,"_62":63},{"_52":148,"_54":149,"_150":151,"_66":152,"_58":153,"_60":-7,"_62":63},{"_52":53,"_54":145,"_56":146,"_58":147,"_60":94,"_62":63},{"_52":53,"_54":142,"_56":143,"_58":144,"_60":94,"_62":63},{"_52":53,"_58":139,"_54":140,"_56":141,"_62":63},{"_52":64,"_58":134,"_54":135,"_66":136},"identitySource","身份来源",[137],{"_54":138,"_26":70},"World Labs","identity","项目身份与署名","The official World Labs product announcement introduces Marble. Use the World Labs brand associated with the product announcement, not a generated scene or a third-party company logo. The SVG is the official site icon linked in https://www.worldlabs.ai/ HTML.","来源核查","2026-10-19","verified","年份","2025","year","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[92,154],"dimensions","世界模型","开发阶段",[158,159,154],"stages","资产与动画","引擎与场景","主题",[163,164,165,166,167],"tags","scene-generation","explicit-3d","Gaussian-splatting","mesh-export","hosted","延伸阅读",[170,171],{"_54":174,"_26":175},{"_54":172,"_26":173},"Web-app mesh export","https://docs.worldlabs.ai/marble/export/mesh","Product","https://marble.worldlabs.ai/","项目源码",[178],{"_54":176,"_26":70},"用途与特点","Marble 支持多模态世界创建，可导出 Gaussian splat、视觉网格和用于近似物理的碰撞网格，并沿相机路径渲染视频。相比纯视频续帧，它提供可交给下游引擎的空间资产，角色行为、任务逻辑与游戏循环仍需开发。所检查网页指南说明碰撞网格导出包含在 Standard 方案中，高质量带纹理 GLB 需要 Pro。","detail","资源类型","工具","分类","category","summary","name","world","tool",[197,198],[163,164,165,166,167],[195,196,188],[108,188],2025,"assets","scene",{"_54":174,"_26":175},{"_54":172,"_26":173},{"_200":201},"documents",{"_63":202,"_36":203},[205,209,210,211,208,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,207,244,206,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262],[204,205,206,207,208],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalo